    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ex-girlfriend called: her parents disappeared, and her mental struggles are back. Go looking for her at her childhood home and uncover a horrible secret in this first-person psychological horror game. Search for clues, talk to strange folks, solve puzzles, run, hide, and improvise to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, inspect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you'll find all sort of items, recordings and notes. While some of them will provide handy information that'll help you advance, most of them will expand on the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/7891c3fac8d442dc4bfa547847becedb.poster.avif?t=1747748453\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/7891c3fac8d442dc4bfa547847becedb.webm?t=1747748453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/7891c3fac8d442dc4bfa547847becedb.mp4?t=1747748453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be ready to run - and hide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, dangers are very real and can get you killed, so be ready to run for your life when time comes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/b1c88c99ee43c18739ce9309d862b104.poster.avif?t=1747748453\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/b1c88c99ee43c18739ce9309d862b104.webm?t=1747748453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/b1c88c99ee43c18739ce9309d862b104.mp4?t=1747748453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use items, improvise</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find items with different functionality that you'll need to adapt to in order to survive. Be ready for some surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/dec0d52bbb0188472909095713d8eba9.poster.avif?t=1747748453\" width=720 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/dec0d52bbb0188472909095713d8eba9.webm?t=1747748453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/dec0d52bbb0188472909095713d8eba9.mp4?t=1747748453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark environment full of secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be ready to run and hide to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to characters to discover new information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to recordings and read notes to get the full picture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and use all kinds of items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QoL settings: FOV, adjustable graphics, remappable input layout, etc.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ex-girlfriend called: her parents disappeared, and her mental struggles are back. Go looking for her at her childhood home and uncover a horrible secret in this first-person psychological horror game. Search for clues, talk to strange folks, solve puzzles, run, hide, and improvise to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, inspect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you'll find all sort of items, recordings and notes. While some of them will provide handy information that'll help you advance, most of them will expand on the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/7891c3fac8d442dc4bfa547847becedb.poster.avif?t=1747748453\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/7891c3fac8d442dc4bfa547847becedb.webm?t=1747748453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/7891c3fac8d442dc4bfa547847becedb.mp4?t=1747748453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be ready to run - and hide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, dangers are very real and can get you killed, so be ready to run for your life when time comes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/b1c88c99ee43c18739ce9309d862b104.poster.avif?t=1747748453\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694980/extras/b1c88c99ee43c18739ce9309d862b104.webm?t=1747748453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app